From baa62794d0f6637d1f11fa6584025000f3434656 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:02:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Bind disk block acceptance to the complete validator
 parameter fingerprint

Hash every fixed header, transaction, VM, monetary and outer-cost parameter in an explicitly versioned local storage format. Exclude dynamic candidate height and MTP only. Check identity and fingerprint before staging, preventing a changed cost schedule from reusing a chainstate. This storage fingerprint is distinct from the network manifest digest. Disk integration and state suites pass.
---
 src/lotus_v2/disk_block.cpp          | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/lotus_v2/disk_block.h            |  5 ++++
 src/lotus_v2/disk_state.cpp          |  4 +++
 src/lotus_v2/disk_state.h            |  1 +
 src/lotus_v2/test_block_complete.cpp |  9 +++++-
 5 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

